  "answer_text": "Because *Miraculous: Tales of Ladybug & Cat Noir* has different episode orders depending on the country, network, or whether you look at the production code vs. the broadcast release, there are three different episodes commonly referred to as **Season 2, Episode 12**. \n\nEach of these episodes has already been released. Their respective titles and release dates are detailed below:\n\n### 1. **\"Sapotis\"** (Production Episode 12 / French Broadcast Order)\nThis episode is officially designated as Episode 12 in production order and is often listed as such on the official Miraculous YouTube channel. \n* **World Premiere (France):** January 21, 2018 (on TF1/TFOU)\n* **US Release (Netflix):** March 30, 2018\n* **UK Premiere:** February 15, 2018\n\n### 2. **\"Captain Hardrock\"** (US Netflix & UK Disney Channel Order)\nIf you are watching on US Netflix or Disney, this episode (production code 216) was widely promoted and distributed as Season 2, Episode 12. \n* **US & UK Release (Netflix/Disney):** March 30, 2018\n* **French Premiere:** May 20, 2018\n\n### 3. **\"Gorizilla\"** (Apple TV, TV Guide & Fandom Airdate Order)\nSome streaming platforms (like Apple TV) and TV tracking guides list \"Gorizilla\" (production code 210) as Episode 12 of Season 2.\n* **World Premiere (Canada):** March 14, 2018\n* **US Release (Netflix):** March 30, 2018\n* **French Premiere:** April 13, 2018",
